/// The root trait of all TOML values.
///
/// Every TOML value conforms to `TomValue`: strings, integers, floats,
/// booleans, arrays and tables. It allows heterogeneous values to be
/// stored uniformly in [`TomArray`](#tomarray) and [`TomTable`](#tomtable).
pub trait TomValue {}
